{"id":"599727eea07e91d7","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-configuration.md","title":"Turing Machine Configuration","display":"df-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-ntm]]"],"display":"df-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration","label":"28-df-configuration","aliases":["28-df-configuration"],"type":"definition","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"12–13,80","source_pdf_pages":"38–39,106"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-configuration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-configuration</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"12–13,80"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"38–39,106"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\">\\(M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}\\)</span>，工作带数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k=k_M\">\\(k=k_M\\)</span>，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e6357334ccd3589d\" href=\"?note=e6357334ccd3589d\" title=\"28-df-ntm\">28-df-ntm</a>。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，有限输入字串写成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}\">\\(x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)\">\\(T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)\">\\(\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_x\">\\(I_x\\)</span> 为只读输入内容，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\">\\(\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\)</span> 为固定输入的配置集。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_x(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\lhd&amp;j=0\\\\x_{j-1}&amp;1\\le j\\le|x|\\\\\\rhd&amp;j=|x|+1\\\\\\sqcup&amp;j&gt;|x|+1.\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_x(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\lhd&amp;j=0\\\\x_{j-1}&amp;1\\le j\\le|x|\\\\\\rhd&amp;j=|x|+1\\\\\\sqcup&amp;j&gt;|x|+1.\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\mid q\\in Q\\land T_0=I_x\\land\\boldsymbol i\\in\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\land i_0\\le|x|+1\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(T_j:\\mathbb N\\to\\Gamma\\land|\\{a\\mid T_j(a)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\mid q\\in Q\\land T_0=I_x\\land\\boldsymbol i\\in\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\land i_0\\le|x|+1\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(T_j:\\mathbb N\\to\\Gamma\\land|\\{a\\mid T_j(a)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|&lt;\\aleph_0)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Conf}(M)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*}\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Conf}(M)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*}\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>配置仍写成三元组，但第二、三分量是所有带的内容与头位置向量。输入内容固定，空间只统计工作带；左端夹停，右端输入头夹停，防止不计费的输入头位置充当额外存储。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.2，印刷 pp.12–13 / PDF pp.38–39；§4.1.1，印刷 p.80 / PDF p.106。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n<p>R7复核：I_x 的 x_{j−1} 采用0基有限串，与 machine-resources 的输出串约定一致。Conf(M) 的全输入并集已在 Assertion 中给出，可供ATM和Step调用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ntm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，工作带数 $k=k_M$，see [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]。\n$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，有限输入字串写成 $x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}$；$T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)$，$\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)$。$I_x$ 为只读输入内容，$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$ 为固定输入的配置集。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ntm","status":"resolved","id":"e6357334ccd3589d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，工作带数 $k=k_M$，see [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]。\n$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，有限输入字串写成 $x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}$；$T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)$，$\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)$。$I_x$ 为只读输入内容，$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$ 为固定输入的配置集。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}","display":false},{"tex":"k=k_M","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"x=x_0\\cdots x_{|x|-1}","display":false},{"tex":"T=(T_0,\\ldots,T_k)","display":false},{"tex":"\\boldsymbol i=(i_0,\\ldots,i_k)","display":false},{"tex":"I_x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)","display":false},{"tex":"I_x(j)\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}\\lhd&j=0\\\\x_{j-1}&1\\le j\\le|x|\\\\\\rhd&j=|x|+1\\\\\\sqcup&j>|x|+1.\\end{cases}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)\\coloneqq\\{\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle\\mid q\\in Q\\land T_0=I_x\\land\\boldsymbol i\\in\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\land i_0\\le|x|+1\\land\\forall j\\in\\{1,\\ldots,k\\}\\;(T_j:\\mathbb N\\to\\Gamma\\land|\\{a\\mid T_j(a)\\ne\\sqcup\\}|<\\aleph_0)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Conf}(M)\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*}\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x).","display":true}],"bytes":1923,"backlinks":[{"id":"9efd20f439611336","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"256220eba4eba968","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$k=k_M$；$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),I_x$ 与 $\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。\n$\\rho=(C_0,\\ldots,C_m)$ 为非空有限配置序列，$\\operatorname{len}(\\rho)=m$ 表示转移步数，$\\operatorname{last}(\\rho)=C_m$；$C.q$ 为配置的状态投影。"},{"id":"1b4d0bd43db4c9c9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$k=k_M$，$x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$，$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$b=s(|x|)$。\n$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x),\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 来自 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]；$\\boldsymbol b=(b_1,\\ldots,b_k)$ 为每带可访问初始区间长度。"},{"id":"6b648ff230619ba2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\cup\\mathrm{NTM}$，$k=k_M$。$c=\\langle q,T,\\boldsymbol i\\rangle,c'=\\langle q',T',\\boldsymbol i'\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{Conf}(M)$，see [[28-df-configuration]]。\n$\\boldsymbol a\\in\\Gamma^k,\\ \\boldsymbol d\\in\\{-1,0,1\\}^{k+1}$；$\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 为待定义关系。"},{"id":"3e7207510b515565","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8330fa9041fa77ae","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\operatorname{Conf}$、$I_x$、$\\operatorname{Step}$ 分别见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]。"},{"id":"ed85cd72838ef590","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M=(Q,\\Sigma,\\Gamma,\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathrm{acc}},q_{\\mathrm{rej}})\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$k=k_M$，见 [[28-df-tm]]。$\\operatorname{Conf}(M,x)$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$、$C^0_{M,x}$、$\\operatorname{out}$ 依次见 [[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-computation]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"语言与停机语义：[[28-df-language]]、[[28-df-decider]]、[[28-df-recognizer]]、[[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-ntm]]、[[28-df-configuration]]、[[28-df-configuration-transition]]、[[28-df-configuration-graph]]、[[28-df-computation]]。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","e6357334ccd3589d"]}